invariant: INV-59
file: mldsa.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh mldsa
reason: HintBitUnpack's check that a row's end is at most omega is gone,
  so an end byte of up to 255 marks a run start past the end of the
  76-byte array of starts. The mldsa proof's bound check on that array
  fails.

--- old
        if (end < last || end > MLD_OMEGA) {
--- new
        if (end < last) {
